; PLAY, rough layout by the game-designer (gdd.md 2.3 and 5); the ui-designer and pixel-artist
; replace it. Rows 0-11: first-person view in the BG (20x12 tiles, double buffer $9800/$9C00).
; Rows 12-17: HUD in the WINDOW (WY=96, map $9C00 rows 0-5), not moved by SCX/SCY.
; View letters = pieces for "corridor, door two cells ahead": A/B side walls depth 0 (S0L/S0R,
; cols 0-3 / 16-19), C/D side walls depth 1 (S1L1/S1R1, cols 4-5 / 14-15, rows 2-9),
; P door front depth 2 (D2, cols 6-13, rows 3-8), '.' background (ceiling rows 0-3,
; darkness 4-7, floor 8-11). Sprites: RATA at depth 1 would stand at x 64..95, y 30..77.
; HUD row 12: V=heart icon, PV 18-20 (the '-' will be the SLASH glyph, E14), E=weapon icon,
; S=shield icon, K=key icon + count, O=potion icon + count, compass letter at col 19.
; Row 13: separator. Rows 14-17: message log, 4 lines x 18 chars (cols 1-18), newest at the bottom.
